cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RefactorPlatform, please cite the paper below."
title: "RefactorPlatform: An Open-Source Harness for Controlled Evaluation of Repository-Scale Refactoring Agents"
abstract: >-
  An open-source evaluation harness for repository-scale refactoring agents. It
  holds the execution environment fixed and varies one design axis at a time:
  model backbone, execution regime (baseline, retrieval-augmented, multi-agent),
  retrieval chunking strategy, and prompt specificity, with per-task isolated
  workspaces, live terminal streaming, token and diff telemetry, AST-based
  verification for Python, and compilation, test and RefactoringMiner gates for
  Java.
